{"id":13,"name":"Snow Storm","description":"Complete Operation Savage Glory.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Operation Savage Glory is the Chapter 5 mission tied to this trophy; finish the chain to claim it.","kind":"story","missable":false,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":1,"name":"PowerPyx roadmap","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-grand-theft-auto-vi-trophy-guide-roadmap"},{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Locate Operation Savage Glory in the Chapter 5 table.","cite":[3,47]},{"text":"Work through the Chapter 5 chain to reach it.","cite":[1,29]},{"text":"Complete the mission without cheats for credit.","cite":[1,17]},{"text":"Save at the end of the chapter.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Tick the trophy in the story filter.","cite":[13,6]},{"text":"Confirm the description on the official PSN list.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Check the chapter assignment against the mission map.","cite":[10,33]}]},
{"id":14,"name":"A Long Road","description":"Attain 100% Completion.","grade":"gold","guide":"The completion gold needs every category closed; treat it as the final ledger item after all cleanup.","kind":"completion","missable":false,"hidden":false,"roadmapStage":5,"sources":[{"id":1,"name":"PowerPyx roadmap","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-grand-theft-auto-vi-trophy-guide-roadmap"},{"id":14,"name":"Push Square 100%","url":"https://www.pushsquare.com/guides/gta-6-100percent-completion-checklist"},{"id":19,"name":"Insider Gaming","url":"https://insider-gaming.com/gta-6-100-completion-a-long-road-trophy/"}],"steps":[{"text":"List every completion category from the 100% checklist.","cite":[14,16]},{"text":"Close story, stranger and collectible categories first.","cite":[3,1]},{"text":"Finish the 70 challenge and 18 meditation targets.","cite":[3,36]},{"text":"Sweep remaining vaults, vehicles and random oddities.","cite":[4,38]},{"text":"Watch the completion percentage reach its final value.","cite":[19,54]},{"text":"Record the gold once the percentage locks.","cite":[2]}],"checks":[{"text":"Reconcile the category list across two checklists.","cite":[18,52]}],"disputes":[{"question":"What exactly counts toward 100% completion?","positionA":"Checklists group story, collectibles, challenges and activities.","positionB":"Some guides treat optional random events as separate.","cites":[14,16,18,19]}]},
{"id":15,"name":"Cunning Stunts","description":"Complete 250 Stunts.","grade":"silver","guide":"Bank stunts naturally while driving between jobs, then finish the last few in a focused session.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"count":250,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":5,"name":"Know GTA 6","url":"https://knowgta6.com/jason-gta-6-trophies-platinum/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":18,"name":"GTASixGuide","url":"https://gtasixguide.com/guides/gta-6-100-percent-completion-checklist/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Read the official tracked target of 250 stunts.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Take ramps and jumps while driving to story jobs.","cite":[5,39]},{"text":"Vary stunt types so repeats do not stall progress.","cite":[3,36]},{"text":"Cluster the last attempts near a reliable ramp.","cite":[18,14]},{"text":"Check the in-game counter before a final run.","cite":[6,51]},{"text":"Verify the silver grade on the trophy list.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Keep a save before the last stunt batch.","cite":[1,16]}],"disputes":[{"question":"Are all stunts counted the same?","positionA":"The description tracks 250 completed stunts.","positionB":"Checklists sometimes separate unique stunt types.","cites":[6,18,3]}]},
{"id":16,"name":"Master of None","description":"Try each type of activity once.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Sample every activity type once; use the activity board to see which categories remain untouched.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":14,"name":"Push Square 100%","url":"https://www.pushsquare.com/guides/gta-6-100percent-completion-checklist"},{"id":18,"name":"GTASixGuide","url":"https://gtasixguide.com/guides/gta-6-100-percent-completion-checklist/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Open the activity board and list its categories.","cite":[3,52]},{"text":"Play one round of each distinct activity type.","cite":[14,18]},{"text":"Do not worry about winning for this bronze.","cite":[3,6]},{"text":"Track tried types in the checklist module.","cite":[13,7]},{"text":"Finish the last untried type to pop the trophy.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Confirm the grade against the PSN table.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Recheck the category count on a second checklist.","cite":[16,52]}]},
{"id":17,"name":"The Shootist","description":"Earn a gold medal in all Shooting Range challenges.","grade":"silver","guide":"Gold every Shooting Range challenge; the tracked set is 42, so work range by range.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"count":42,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":7,"name":"Game Checklists","url":"https://game-checklists.com/gta6/achievements-checklist/"},{"id":46,"name":"Push Square Challenges","url":"https://www.pushsquare.com/guides/gta-6-challenges"}],"steps":[{"text":"Confirm the tracked challenge count of 42.","cite":[6,7]},{"text":"Read the medal thresholds before each run.","cite":[46,36]},{"text":"Gold the challenges in one range before moving on.","cite":[7,3]},{"text":"Retry a missed medal with a clean save.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Tick the final gold in the tracker.","cite":[13,6]},{"text":"Verify the silver grade against Exophase.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Compare the 42 figure with the challenge checklist.","cite":[7,36]}],"disputes":[{"question":"Are all 42 range challenges required for gold?","positionA":"Exophase and Game Checklists track 42 challenges.","positionB":"One guide counts only the medal tiers in a subset.","cites":[6,7,36]}]},
{"id":18,"name":"Top Fun","description":"Win a Top Fun Drone Race at every location.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Win each drone race location in turn; mark them off so the last circuit is obvious.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":14,"name":"Push Square 100%","url":"https://www.pushsquare.com/guides/gta-6-100percent-completion-checklist"}],"steps":[{"text":"List the drone race markers from the checklist.","cite":[3,14]},{"text":"Win one race at each listed location.","cite":[3,6]},{"text":"Re-run a venue if the first win did not register.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Group nearby venues into one driving loop.","cite":[5,39]},{"text":"Mark the last win in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Confirm the bronze grade on the PSN list.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Cross-check the location list with another checklist.","cite":[14,18]}],"disputes":[{"question":"How many drone race locations are there?","positionA":"Guide trackers list every marked drone race venue.","positionB":"Completion checklists differ on whether variants count.","cites":[3,14,18]}]},
{"id":19,"name":"Earn Cash, Not Kudos","description":"Win 20 different races.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Win twenty distinct races; rotate venues so duplicate runs do not pad the counter.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"count":20,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":14,"name":"Push Square 100%","url":"https://www.pushsquare.com/guides/gta-6-100percent-completion-checklist"}],"steps":[{"text":"Verify the official target of twenty wins.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Enter a different race each time you compete.","cite":[3,14]},{"text":"Take wins while driving between other objectives.","cite":[5,39]},{"text":"Keep a short list of already-won venues.","cite":[13,7]},{"text":"Finish the twentieth distinct win.","cite":[6,51]},{"text":"Check the bronze grade after the pop.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Reconcile the count with the checklist module.","cite":[14,51]}]},
{"id":20,"name":"Baited My Tackle","description":"Beat Cal in a fishing challenge.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Take Cal's fishing challenge and win it cleanly; the trophy follows the result screen.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":5,"name":"Know GTA 6","url":"https://knowgta6.com/jason-gta-6-trophies-platinum/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Find Cal's fishing challenge on the map.","cite":[3,5]},{"text":"Accept the challenge from the marked contact.","cite":[3,6]},{"text":"Beat Cal's score before the timer expires.","cite":[3,14]},{"text":"Save afterwards in case a retry is needed.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Tick the activity in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Confirm the bronze grade on the list.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Cross-check the challenge name with the guide.","cite":[3,21]}]},
{"id":21,"name":"Stick Fiddler","description":"Complete an arcade game.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Finish one full arcade game; a single completed run is enough for the bronze.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":14,"name":"Push Square 100%","url":"https://www.pushsquare.com/guides/gta-6-100percent-completion-checklist"}],"steps":[{"text":"Locate an arcade cabinet on the activity map.","cite":[3,14]},{"text":"Start a game and play through to its results.","cite":[3,6]},{"text":"A loss still counts if the game finishes.","cite":[14,3]},{"text":"Save after the result screen.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Mark the bronze in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Verify the trophy grade against Exophase.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Check the activity type in the 100% list.","cite":[14,52]}],"disputes":[{"question":"Must an arcade game be won?","positionA":"The description asks only to complete one.","positionB":"Some guides say finish with a win.","cites":[6,14,3]}]},
{"id":22,"name":"Road to Rehabilitation","description":"Complete the final mission for Andy.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Andy's stranger strand ends with this mission; complete the last job in his chain.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":30,"name":"PowerPyx Strangers","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-strangers-and-freaks-guide/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Find Andy's strand in the eight-strand list.","cite":[3,35]},{"text":"Work through his jobs in the listed order.","cite":[30,3]},{"text":"Complete the final mission for Andy.","cite":[3,6]},{"text":"Save once the strand closes.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Tick the strand in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Confirm the grade on the PSN list.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Count this strand toward the eight-strand trophy.","cite":[3,30]}]},
{"id":23,"name":"This Was No Boat Accident","description":"Complete the final mission for Kenton.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Kenton's final stranger mission is the target; finish his whole chain before the last job.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":30,"name":"PowerPyx Strangers","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-strangers-and-freaks-guide/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Locate Kenton's strand among the eight.","cite":[3,35]},{"text":"Follow the strand jobs in the guide order.","cite":[30,3]},{"text":"Finish the final mission for Kenton.","cite":[3,6]},{"text":"Save after the strand end card.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Mark the completion in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Check the bronze grade on Exophase.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Verify the strand is part of the full set.","cite":[35,30]}]},
{"id":24,"name":"The Lone Rider","description":"Complete the final mission for Billy.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Billy's chain ends here; keep the strand order straight so the final marker appears.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":30,"name":"PowerPyx Strangers","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-strangers-and-freaks-guide/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Identify Billy's strand in the stranger table.","cite":[3,35]},{"text":"Play each Billy job in sequence.","cite":[30,3]},{"text":"Complete his final mission for the bronze.","cite":[3,6]},{"text":"Save before leaving the area.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Tick the strand in the ledger.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Cross-check the grade with the PSN table.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Confirm the strand is one of the eight.","cite":[3,30]}]},
{"id":25,"name":"Strangers & Freaks","description":"Complete 8 mission strands for strangers across the state of Leonida.","grade":"silver","guide":"Finish all eight full stranger strands; the individual end trophies are good checkpoints.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"count":8,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":30,"name":"PowerPyx Strangers","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-strangers-and-freaks-guide/"},{"id":57,"name":"Duuro Strands","url":"https://duuro.net/blog/gta-6-trophy-guide#strangers"}],"steps":[{"text":"List the eight complete strands from the guide.","cite":[3,35]},{"text":"Count Andy, Kenton, Billy and the other named chains.","cite":[30,57]},{"text":"Work one strand through to its end before switching.","cite":[3,30]},{"text":"Use the individual end trophies as progress markers.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Finish the eighth strand for the silver.","cite":[3,35]},{"text":"Verify the grade on the PSN list.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Cross-check the strand total with a second guide.","cite":[57,35]}],"disputes":[{"question":"Do partial strands count toward eight?","positionA":"gta.guide describes eight full strands.","positionB":"One tracker counts any eight stranger missions.","cites":[3,30,57]}]},
{"id":26,"name":"Supply & Demand","description":"Complete the final mission for Randy.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Randy's last stranger mission completes his strand; finish the earlier jobs first.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":30,"name":"PowerPyx Strangers","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-strangers-and-freaks-guide/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Find Randy's strand entry in the guide.","cite":[3,35]},{"text":"Clear the preceding Randy jobs in order.","cite":[30,3]},{"text":"Finish the final mission for Randy.","cite":[3,6]},{"text":"Save at the strand end card.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Mark the bronze in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Confirm the official description on Exophase.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Count the strand toward the silver trophy.","cite":[3,35]}],"disputes":[{"question":"Is Randy one of the eight full strands?","positionA":"gta.guide names Randy among the stranger chains.","positionB":"One tracker groups his jobs as a side mission.","cites":[3,30,57]}]},
{"id":27,"name":"Spin On This!","description":"Complete the final mission for Tyrone.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Tyrone's chain closes the last listed strand; finish it to complete the eight-strand set.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":30,"name":"PowerPyx Strangers","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-strangers-and-freaks-guide/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Locate Tyrone's strand in the eight-strand table.","cite":[3,35]},{"text":"Play his jobs in the recorded order.","cite":[30,3]},{"text":"Finish the final mission for Tyrone.","cite":[3,6]},{"text":"Save after the last strand end card.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Tick the bronze in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Verify the grade on the trophy table.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Use this as the eighth strand checkpoint.","cite":[35,3]}]},
{"id":28,"name":"Positive Mental Attitude","description":"Meditate at every spot across Leonida.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Meditate at all eighteen spots; take the Chapter 1 balcony spot early because sources disagree on its window.","kind":"missable","missable":true,"hidden":false,"count":18,"roadmapStage":1,"sources":[{"id":1,"name":"PowerPyx roadmap","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-grand-theft-auto-vi-trophy-guide-roadmap"},{"id":2,"name":"Output Lag","url":"https://outputlag.com/guides/gta-6-trophy-list/"},{"id":34,"name":"gta.guide Meditations","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements#meditations"}],"steps":[{"text":"Check the eighteen meditation spots in the register.","cite":[34,6]},{"text":"Do the Chapter 1 balcony meditation during that chapter.","cite":[1,2]},{"text":"Save manually before leaving Chapter 1.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Meditate at remaining spots as they become reachable.","cite":[5,34]},{"text":"Track your count with the plus and minus controls.","cite":[13,51]},{"text":"Finish the last spot and verify the bronze.","cite":[34]}],"checks":[{"text":"Cross-check the eighteen total with another tracker.","cite":[6,8]}],"window":"Chapter 1 balcony spot: do it before the chapter closes.","disputes":[{"question":"Is the Chapter 1 meditation truly missable?","positionA":"PowerPyx calls Positive Mental Attitude possible-missable in Chapter 1.","positionB":"BestGTA6 lists it among missables while output trackers treat all spots as revisitable.","cites":[1,4,2,34],"unconfirmed":true}]},
{"id":29,"name":"Fair Game","description":"Hunt a unique animal for Bret.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Bret's hunting request needs the unique animal; follow his 15-target hunt chain to the special kill.","kind":"collectibles","missable":false,"hidden":false,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":4,"name":"BestGTA6","url":"https://bestgta6.life/trophies/"},{"id":56,"name":"games.gg Collectibles","url":"https://games.gg/grand-theft-auto-vi/guides/gta-6-complete-checklist/#collectibles"}],"steps":[{"text":"Check the 100-animal target in the register.","cite":[4,38]},{"text":"Accept Bret's hunting requests from his contact.","cite":[3,56]},{"text":"Work through his fifteen hunts in order.","cite":[3,4]},{"text":"Take the unique animal when Bret flags it.","cite":[3,6]},{"text":"Save after the special kill.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Verify the bronze on the PSN list.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Count this animal within the hundred target.","cite":[4,56]}]},
{"id":30,"name":"Don't Touch My Deck","description":"Complete 3 Collectible Card sets.","grade":"silver","guide":"Complete three full card sets; trade duplicates and use the card map to finish sets efficiently.","kind":"collectibles","missable":false,"hidden":false,"count":3,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":15,"name":"Push Square Cards","url":"https://www.pushsquare.com/guides/gta-6-collectible-card-locations"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":31,"name":"PowerPyx Collectibles","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-collectibles-guide/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Read the card set list and pick three targets.","cite":[15,31]},{"text":"Collect cards from the mapped locations.","cite":[15,3]},{"text":"Trade duplicates to complete missing slots.","cite":[15,6]},{"text":"Mark each finished set in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Complete the third set to trigger the silver.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Cross-check the grade on the PSN table.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Verify that three means full sets, not three cards.","cite":[15,6]}],"disputes":[{"question":"Does the trophy need three full sets or three cards?","positionA":"The official wording says three Collectible Card sets.","positionB":"Some checklists shorthand it as three collected sets.","cites":[6,15,31]}]},
{"id":31,"name":"You WAiNKer!","description":"WAiNK It at 100 locations.","grade":"silver","guide":"WAiNK at one hundred locations; fold the scans into driving routes between other objectives.","kind":"collectibles","missable":false,"hidden":false,"count":100,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":5,"name":"Know GTA 6","url":"https://knowgta6.com/jason-gta-6-trophies-platinum/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":31,"name":"PowerPyx Collectibles","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-collectibles-guide/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Confirm the official target of one hundred scans.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Scan WAiNK points while driving between jobs.","cite":[5,39]},{"text":"Use the collectible map to avoid repeat locations.","cite":[31,56]},{"text":"Keep a running tally in the tracker.","cite":[13,51]},{"text":"Perform scan one hundred.","cite":[6,51]},{"text":"Verify the silver grade on Exophase.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Cross-check the count against another collector.","cite":[31,56]}],"disputes":[{"question":"Do repeat scans advance the hundred count?","positionA":"Checklists describe one hundred distinct locations.","positionB":"Some players count any repeated scan action.","cites":[5,31,6]}]},
{"id":32,"name":"One Last Thing","description":"Complete 50 Challenges.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Complete fifty of the available challenges; the wider list runs to seventy or eighty depending on the source.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"count":50,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":36,"name":"gta.guide Challenges","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements#challenges"}],"steps":[{"text":"Confirm the trophy needs fifty completed challenges.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Choose the easiest fifty from the challenge list.","cite":[36,3]},{"text":"Finish challenges in clusters by district.","cite":[3,14]},{"text":"Mark each completion in the checklist.","cite":[13,7]},{"text":"Finish challenge number fifty.","cite":[6,51]},{"text":"Check the bronze grade against Exophase.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Compare the available challenge total across sources.","cite":[36,18]}],"disputes":[{"question":"How many challenges exist in total?","positionA":"gta.guide counts seventy challenges available.","positionB":"Other checklists list up to eighty.","cites":[3,36,18]}]},
{"id":33,"name":"Hot Together","description":"Lose a 4 star Wanted Level with your partner and escape the heat.","grade":"bronze","guide":"With your partner present, draw a four-star wanted level and lose it together.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":2,"name":"Output Lag","url":"https://outputlag.com/guides/gta-6-trophy-list/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":8,"name":"PSNProfiles","url":"https://psnprofiles.com/games/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Check the official four-star condition in the list.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Have your partner with you before raising heat.","cite":[2,32]},{"text":"Reach four stars and drive away as a pair.","cite":[2,1]},{"text":"Break line of sight until the wanted level clears.","cite":[2,6]},{"text":"Tick the bronze in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Verify the exact description on the PSN list.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Make sure both characters survive the escape.","cite":[2,6]}]},
{"id":34,"name":"Retail Therapy","description":"Rob 3 shops back-to-back with your partner without losing your Wanted Level.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Rob three shops in one continuous chain with your partner, keeping the wanted level alive between them.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":2,"name":"Output Lag","url":"https://outputlag.com/guides/gta-6-trophy-list/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":8,"name":"PSNProfiles","url":"https://psnprofiles.com/games/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Read the back-to-back condition in the description.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Bring your partner before the first shop.","cite":[2,32]},{"text":"Rob the first shop and keep moving fast.","cite":[2,1]},{"text":"Hit two more shops before the heat clears.","cite":[2,6]},{"text":"Mark the bronze in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Confirm the grade on the PSN table.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Pick three close shops to keep the chain alive.","cite":[2,5]}]},
{"id":35,"name":"Whip It Good","description":"Discover 100 vehicles.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Discover one hundred vehicles; the wider completion target is two hundred, so this is the first milestone.","kind":"collectibles","missable":false,"hidden":true,"count":100,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":4,"name":"BestGTA6","url":"https://bestgta6.life/trophies/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":31,"name":"PowerPyx Collectibles","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-collectibles-guide/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Confirm the first milestone is one hundred vehicles.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Drive a new model each time you travel.","cite":[5,39]},{"text":"Use the vehicle list to avoid duplicates.","cite":[31,56]},{"text":"Track discovered models in the ledger.","cite":[13,51]},{"text":"Reach the hundredth discovery.","cite":[6,51]},{"text":"Verify the bronze grade.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Note that completion eventually tracks two hundred.","cite":[4,38]}],"disputes":[{"question":"Does discovery mean-driving or owning?","positionA":"Official wording says discover one hundred vehicles.","positionB":"Completion checklists sometimes count owned garage slots.","cites":[6,4,31]}]},
{"id":36,"name":"Gunslinger","description":"Take down 5 enemies in a single use of Combat Focus.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Save Combat Focus for a group of five enemies, then tag and down them inside one activation.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":2,"name":"Output Lag","url":"https://outputlag.com/guides/gta-6-trophy-list/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":8,"name":"PSNProfiles","url":"https://psnprofiles.com/games/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Check the single-activation rule in the description.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Find a cluster of at least five enemies.","cite":[2,1]},{"text":"Activate Combat Focus and tag each target.","cite":[2,6]},{"text":"Down all five before the focus ends.","cite":[2,2]},{"text":"Tick the bronze in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Confirm the exact wording on Exophase.","cite":[6]}],"checks":[{"text":"Retry at another encounter if the fifth is missed.","cite":[1,16]}]},
{"id":37,"name":"Catch Me If You Can","description":"Make an unscheduled departure at VCIA.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Use the pre-VCIA save to attempt the unscheduled departure; this is one of the at-risk airport oddities.","kind":"missable","missable":true,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":3,"sources":[{"id":1,"name":"PowerPyx roadmap","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-grand-theft-auto-vi-trophy-guide-roadmap"},{"id":4,"name":"BestGTA6","url":"https://bestgta6.life/trophies/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Read the airport window in the missable register.","cite":[4,37]},{"text":"Save before starting VCIA Takedown.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Try the unscheduled departure during the mission.","cite":[1,4]},{"text":"Reload the save if the door option is gone.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Tick the bronze once the pop appears.","cite":[13,6]},{"text":"Verify the exact name on Exophase.","cite":[6]}],"window":"During VCIA Takedown, Chapter 4.","disputes":[{"question":"Is the VCIA departure only possible during the mission?","positionA":"Missable lists tie it to the VCIA Takedown window.","positionB":"Some checklists treat it as a free-roam airport interaction.","cites":[4,1,37]}]},
{"id":38,"name":"Challenging Tank","description":"Kinda hot in these Rhinos.","grade":"bronze","guide":"The Rhinos line points to the tank encounter; handle it during the available window and keep a save.","kind":"missable","missable":true,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":1,"name":"PowerPyx roadmap","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-grand-theft-auto-vi-trophy-guide-roadmap"},{"id":4,"name":"BestGTA6","url":"https://bestgta6.life/trophies/"},{"id":40,"name":"Know GTA 6 Cleanup","url":"https://knowgta6.com/jason-gta-6-trophies-platinum/#cleanup"}],"steps":[{"text":"Check the tank oddity in the cleanup register.","cite":[40,4]},{"text":"Save before approaching the Rhino encounter.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Trigger the tank event during its available window.","cite":[4,40]},{"text":"Complete the encounter to earn the bronze.","cite":[1,6]},{"text":"Mark it in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Confirm the grade against Exophase.","cite":[6]}],"window":"Story-linked tank encounter; save before triggering.","disputes":[{"question":"Is the tank encounter a fixed story event?","positionA":"Cleanup routes place it in the story-linked window.","positionB":"Free-roam checklists list it as always available.","cites":[40,4,1]}]},
{"id":39,"name":"Sneakthief","description":"Rob a jewelry store without being detected.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Plan a clean jewelry store robbery: enter unseen and leave before an alarm identifies you.","kind":"missable","missable":true,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":4,"name":"BestGTA6","url":"https://bestgta6.life/trophies/"},{"id":1,"name":"PowerPyx roadmap","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-grand-theft-auto-vi-trophy-guide-roadmap"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Read the undetected condition in the description.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Pick a jewelry store with a quiet approach.","cite":[4,1]},{"text":"Save just before entering the store.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Rob it without raising a wanted level.","cite":[4,6]},{"text":"Tick the bronze in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Verify the exact grade on Exophase.","cite":[6]}],"window":"Any jewelry store robbery; save before entry."},
{"id":40,"name":"Maximum Withdrawal","description":"Rob 5 Bank Vaults and escape.","grade":"silver","guide":"Rob and escape five vaults; the wider completion register counts eight, so five is the trophy threshold.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"count":5,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":4,"name":"BestGTA6","url":"https://bestgta6.life/trophies/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":14,"name":"Push Square 100%","url":"https://www.pushsquare.com/guides/gta-6-100percent-completion-checklist"}],"steps":[{"text":"Confirm the trophy threshold is five vaults.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Check the eight-vault total in the register.","cite":[4,38]},{"text":"Save before each vault attempt.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Escape after the fifth successful vault.","cite":[4,14]},{"text":"Mark the silver in the tracker.","cite":[13,6]},{"text":"Verify the grade on the PSN table.","cite":[6]}],"disputes":[{"question":"Are five or eight vaults needed?","positionA":"The trophy description says five vaults and escape.","positionB":"Completion checklists count eight vaults overall.","cites":[6,4,14]}]},
{"id":41,"name":"A Classic Blitz Play","description":"Rob an Armored Truck and escape.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Stop an armored truck, take the cargo and get away; a clean pre-attempt save helps with retries.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":4,"name":"BestGTA6","url":"https://bestgta6.life/trophies/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":14,"name":"Push Square 100%","url":"https://www.pushsquare.com/guides/gta-6-100percent-completion-checklist"}],"steps":[{"text":"Check the armored truck entry in the checklist.","cite":[14,4]},{"text":"Save before intercepting a truck.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Stop the truck and take the cargo.","cite":[4,6]},{"text":"Escape the pursuit to trigger the bronze.","cite":[4,14]},{"text":"Mark it in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Confirm the grade on Exophase.","cite":[6]}]},
{"id":42,"name":"The Goodtime State","description":"Explore all of Leonida.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Fill in every mapped area of Leonida; the exploration grid is a slow drift best handled during routing.","kind":"collectibles","missable":false,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":5,"sources":[{"id":1,"name":"PowerPyx roadmap","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-grand-theft-auto-vi-trophy-guide-roadmap"},{"id":14,"name":"Push Square 100%","url":"https://www.pushsquare.com/guides/gta-6-100percent-completion-checklist"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Read the exploration requirement in the description.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Open the map and note unexplored sectors.","cite":[14,16]},{"text":"Drive through each remaining sector.","cite":[5,39]},{"text":"Let the map reveal settle before moving on.","cite":[14,3]},{"text":"Finish the final sector for the bronze.","cite":[6,51]},{"text":"Cross-check the grade with the PSN list.","cite":[6]}],"disputes":[{"question":"How many areas make up all of Leonida?","positionA":"One checklist counts a fixed set of named districts.","positionB":"Another counts any map sector that reveals.","cites":[14,16,52]}]},
{"id":43,"name":"Pest Control","description":"Rob an Illegal Operation belonging to each gang.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Hit one illegal operation for every gang; use the gang operation total as a checklist rather than assuming a small set.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":false,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":4,"name":"BestGTA6","url":"https://bestgta6.life/trophies/"},{"id":3,"name":"gta.guide","url":"https://gta.guide/gta-6/guides/trophies-and-achievements"},{"id":52,"name":"GTASixGuide Categories","url":"https://gtasixguide.com/guides/gta-6-100-percent-completion-checklist/#categories"}],"steps":[{"text":"Check the gang operation total in the register.","cite":[4,38]},{"text":"List the gangs with an illegal operation.","cite":[3,52]},{"text":"Rob one operation for each gang.","cite":[4,3]},{"text":"Mark each gang off in the tracker.","cite":[13,7]},{"text":"Finish the last gang operation.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Verify the bronze grade against Exophase.","cite":[6]}],"disputes":[{"question":"Does each gang need one operation or all of them?","positionA":"The description says one operation belonging to each gang.","positionB":"Completion lists track a much larger set of operations.","cites":[6,4,52]}]},
{"id":44,"name":"In The Beginning…","description":"Enjoy a cocktail with a view on Ocean Beach.","grade":"bronze","guide":"The cryptic description points to an early Ocean Beach cocktail; treat it as a windowed oddity and save first.","kind":"missable","missable":true,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":1,"sources":[{"id":1,"name":"PowerPyx roadmap","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-grand-theft-auto-vi-trophy-guide-roadmap"},{"id":2,"name":"Output Lag","url":"https://outputlag.com/guides/gta-6-trophy-list/"},{"id":37,"name":"BestGTA6 Missables","url":"https://bestgta6.life/trophies/#missables"}],"steps":[{"text":"Read the Ocean Beach clue in the missable register.","cite":[37,2]},{"text":"Save before the early chapter where the view opens.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Take the cocktail at the Ocean Beach viewpoint.","cite":[2,37]},{"text":"Watch for the trophy pop on the result.","cite":[2,6]},{"text":"Tick the bronze in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Confirm the exact ellipsis in the name.","cite":[6]}],"window":"Early Ocean Beach visit; save before the chapter closes.","disputes":[{"question":"Is the cocktail locked to an early chapter?","positionA":"Missable registers place it in the opening window.","positionB":"Other lists treat it as a free-roam location.","cites":[37,1,2]}]},
{"id":45,"name":"Capital Offense","description":"Smash your way out of a vehicle showroom in classic style.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Drive through a vehicle showroom in a dramatic exit; the phrasing suggests a scripted or specific stunt trigger.","kind":"missable","missable":true,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":2,"sources":[{"id":1,"name":"PowerPyx roadmap","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-grand-theft-auto-vi-trophy-guide-roadmap"},{"id":4,"name":"BestGTA6","url":"https://bestgta6.life/trophies/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Read the showroom clue in the trophy description.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Save before trying the showroom exit.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Enter a vehicle showroom and build speed.","cite":[4,1]},{"text":"Smash out through the display in classic style.","cite":[4,6]},{"text":"Mark the bronze in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Verify the grade on the PSN table.","cite":[6]}],"window":"Showroom exit; save before entering."},
{"id":46,"name":"Let’s Go Bowling","description":"Follow-through at the Kolt & Associates' bowling alley.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Bowl at the Kolt & Associates alley and finish with a follow-through; sources differ on whether the trigger is story-linked.","kind":"missable","missable":true,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":1,"sources":[{"id":1,"name":"PowerPyx roadmap","url":"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-grand-theft-auto-vi-trophy-guide-roadmap"},{"id":2,"name":"Output Lag","url":"https://outputlag.com/guides/gta-6-trophy-list/"},{"id":10,"name":"Leonida Interactive","url":"https://leonidainteractive.com/wiki/guides/trophies-achievements/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Check the Ch1 balcony and alley note in the guide.","cite":[2,1]},{"text":"Save before approaching the bowling alley.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Play a frame at Kolt & Associates.","cite":[2,10]},{"text":"Hold the follow-through until the pop appears.","cite":[2,6]},{"text":"Tick the bronze in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Verify the exact curved apostrophe in the name.","cite":[6]}],"window":"Kolt & Associates alley; possibly Chapter 1 linked.","disputes":[{"question":"Is bowling tied to a story chapter?","positionA":"One guide places the alley trigger in Chapter 1.","positionB":"Leonida Interactive marks the trigger unconfirmed.","cites":[2,10,1],"unconfirmed":true}]},
{"id":47,"name":"Personal Best","description":"A partnership with mass appeal.","grade":"bronze","guide":"The vague wording points to a partner-based popularity milestone; check both characters before assuming a single trigger.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":2,"name":"Output Lag","url":"https://outputlag.com/guides/gta-6-trophy-list/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":8,"name":"PSNProfiles","url":"https://psnprofiles.com/games/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Read the partnership clue on the PSN list.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Raise both characters' public profile.","cite":[2,32]},{"text":"Trigger the mass-appeal milestone with your partner.","cite":[2,6]},{"text":"Save after the event resolves.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Mark the bronze in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Confirm the exact description on Exophase.","cite":[6]}]},
{"id":48,"name":"Actions Speak Louder","description":"Choices made (for better or worse).","grade":"bronze","guide":"This tracks accumulated choices; keep making story and side decisions and the counter will advance.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":7,"name":"Game Checklists","url":"https://game-checklists.com/gta6/achievements-checklist/"},{"id":8,"name":"PSNProfiles","url":"https://psnprofiles.com/games/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Check the tracked choice counter on Exophase.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Make choices in story missions as they appear.","cite":[1,3]},{"text":"Take side-job decisions instead of skipping them.","cite":[5,39]},{"text":"Track your own tally in the ledger.","cite":[13,51]},{"text":"Reach the final counted choice.","cite":[6,51]},{"text":"Verify the bronze grade on the list.","cite":[6]}],"disputes":[{"question":"How many choices does the counter require?","positionA":"Trackers list a hidden counter that climbs with decisions.","positionB":"Some checklists round the target differently.","cites":[6,7,8]}]},
{"id":49,"name":"Bad Luck, I Guess","description":"Second time's the charm.","grade":"bronze","guide":"A retry reward: fail once at the relevant action, then succeed on the second attempt.","kind":"activities","missable":false,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":2,"name":"Output Lag","url":"https://outputlag.com/guides/gta-6-trophy-list/"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"},{"id":8,"name":"PSNProfiles","url":"https://psnprofiles.com/games/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Read the second-chance clue in the description.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Attempt the related action once and fail.","cite":[2,32]},{"text":"Save at the failure point if possible.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Succeed on the immediate second attempt.","cite":[2,6]},{"text":"Tick the bronze in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Verify the grade against Exophase.","cite":[6]}]},
{"id":50,"name":"The Truth Is Out There","description":"What the hell just happened?","grade":"bronze","guide":"The UFO-style oddity in the cleanup route; follow the strange-event lead rather than the main missions.","kind":"missable","missable":true,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":5,"sources":[{"id":5,"name":"Know GTA 6","url":"https://knowgta6.com/jason-gta-6-trophies-platinum/"},{"id":40,"name":"Know GTA 6 Cleanup","url":"https://knowgta6.com/jason-gta-6-trophies-platinum/#cleanup"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Check the UFO cleanup note in the route.","cite":[40,5]},{"text":"Save before chasing the strange event.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Follow the oddity lead to its final moment.","cite":[40,6]},{"text":"Watch for the mysterious-event pop.","cite":[5,2]},{"text":"Mark the bronze in the tracker.","cite":[13,8]},{"text":"Confirm the exact description on Exophase.","cite":[6]}],"window":"Post-story strange event; save before the encounter.","disputes":[{"question":"Is the strange event tied to a specific time?","positionA":"Cleanup routes put it in the post-story sweep.","positionB":"Some lists allow it during free roam earlier.","cites":[40,5,14]}]},
{"id":51,"name":"Ten Pin","description":"Bowl 'em over with a melee drive-by.","grade":"bronze","guide":"Knock someone down with melee from a moving vehicle; the exact trigger is unconfirmed, so keep a save.","kind":"missable","missable":true,"hidden":true,"roadmapStage":4,"sources":[{"id":10,"name":"Leonida Interactive","url":"https://leonidainteractive.com/wiki/guides/trophies-achievements/"},{"id":48,"name":"Leonida Ten Pin","url":"https://leonidainteractive.com/wiki/guides/trophies-achievements/#ten-pin"},{"id":6,"name":"Exophase","url":"https://www.exophase.com/game/grand-theft-auto-vi-psn/trophies/"}],"steps":[{"text":"Read the melee drive-by wording on Exophase.","cite":[6,8]},{"text":"Check the unconfirmed trigger note in the wiki.","cite":[10,48]},{"text":"Save before attempting the moving melee hit.","cite":[1,16]},{"text":"Strike a pedestrian from a driving vehicle.","cite":[48,10]},{"text":"Mark the bronze if the pop appears.","cite":[13,6]},{"text":"Verify the grade against a second index.","cite":[6]}],"window":"Free roam, unconfirmed; save before the attempt.","disputes":[{"question":"Does Ten Pin require a specific vehicle or location?","positionA":"Leonida Interactive records an unconfirmed melee drive-by trigger.","positionB":"Other lists read it as any moving melee takedown.","cites":[10,48,6],"unconfirmed":true}]},
